## English

Fikir Social Café is a specialty coffee roaster near Madrid, Spain, selling single-origin coffees from Ethiopia, Kenya and Uganda online (shipping to mainland Spain only). The company reinvests 100% of its annual net profit in social projects in those origin countries. English version of the shop: {{ base }}/en
